      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Despite numerous efforts to establish an adequate pain treatment, many patients still do not receive a proper pain therapy. This is unfortunate as it is estimated that between 5 and 7.6 Mi. people are suffering from chronic pain in Germany. This paper is demonstrating an adequate pain management for different diseases including an interdisciplinary approach. Further, we hope to reduce the fear of many physicians for the administration of opioid analgetics to realize a proper pain treatment where indicated."},
